When you eat a floating eye corpse it will come up with the message "You feel a
strange mental accuity (sp??)". This means that you now have ESP (not sure if
nethack calls it that). In other words, when you have been blinded (or are
wearing a blindfold) you can sense all the monsters on that Dlvl (not sure if
you can see Wiz etc.).

This is very useful when: a) looking for nymphs or leprachans.
                          b) checking for mimics.
                          c) fighting Medusa.
                          d) and lots o' other things.

